{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">High-octane looter-shooter fused with node alchemy\u2014morph your dynamic node matrix, collect epic loot, and dominate the battlefield with unstoppable power.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Cut to the Chase</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3061690/extras/Autoskills.gif?t=1750418284\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Forget bloated lore \u2014dive straight into streamlined combat and progression that rewards smart builds.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Node Alchemy, Legendary Power</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3061690/extras/SkillTree_v2.gif?t=1750418284\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Explore a vast skill tree with over 1,300 nodes. Transmute entire node categories\u2014turn defense into offense or swap one skill for another. Stack node multipliers to amplify your favorite abilities and achieve exponential growth. Master complex, multi-layered synergies as you sculpt your character into a living legend.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Hordes and Swarm Lords</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3061690/extras/AboutGame.gif?t=1750418284\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Fight through relentless insect arenas\u2014adapt your build to crush swarming hordes and towering boss monstrosities. Venture further and face ever-more formidable Swarm Lords\u2014push your build beyond its limits.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3061690?t=1750418284","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3061690/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1750418284","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.